error[SC0524]: this type alias expands into itself
  --> tests/ui/types/cyclic_alias.science:13:6
   |
13 | type Name is Label
   |      ^^^^ expanding this alias reaches it again
14 |
15 | type Label is Name
   |      ----- and through this one
   |
   = note: `Name`, which expands into `Label`, which expands into `Name`
   = note: an alias is another name for the type on its right, so a cycle names no type at all — a type that contains itself is a record or a choice, which has a field to hold it and a size the compiler can compute
